// Cred Dump Tools Dropped Files | T1003.001, T1003.002, T1003.003, T1003.004, T1003.005 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/file/file_event/file_event_win_cred_dump_tools_dropped_files.yml
